# Workspace wrapper repo — tracks only the shared setup around the apps.
# Each app (lms-erp, lms-erp-tenant, lms-erp-admin, bilig_user_web,
# bilig-landing) is its own git repo and must never be committed here.
#
# Whitelist: ignore everything at the root, then re-include the setup files.
# A new app folder dropped in later is ignored automatically; a new root-level
# setup file must be added below with a `!` line.
/*

!/.gitignore
!/.gitattributes
!/.claude/
!/AGENTS.md
!/CLAUDE.md
!/Makefile
!/README.md

# Machine-local Claude Code state
/.claude/settings.local.json
/.claude/scheduled_tasks.lock

# Secrets, should one ever land in the setup files
.env
.env.*
